长袖去接，双掌几乎相触。两人\n  同节奏侧步，绕对方转一圈，她的黑纱披与他的袍角随转身甩开。[镜头2] 00:04.000 切到略低机位的全景，两人并肩在庭院中央面向\n  镜头跳，每一记鼓点轻踏石板，水袖先向右扬起再横扫向左，再踏一步。老妇人保持严肃神情和挺直身姿、宽袖翻飞；男子面带笑意，\n  每拍屈膝、随节奏轻晃头。镜头小幅慢速向右弧形环绕。最后一拍两人在画面中央背靠背落定，双袖高举定格，笛鼓同时收音。\n  - 环境音：安静的傍晚庭院氛围，轻风穿过木檐。宽袖破空声、布鞋在石板上有节奏的轻踏声，混着她头饰的细微叮当声。\n  - 配乐：N/A（笛鼓是现场声，写在正文里了）"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [1106.9599609375, 0], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [280, 281], "label": "输出", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "output"}, {"name": "denoised_output", "links": [], "label": "降噪输出", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "denoised_output"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "noise", "link": 253, "label": "噪波生成", "type": "NOISE", "localized_name": "noise"}, {"name": "guider", "link": 254, "label": "引导", "type": "GUIDER", "localized_name": "guider"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 255, "label": "采样器", "type": "SAMPLER", "localized_name": "sampler"}, {"name": "sigmas", "link": 256, "label": "Sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "sigmas"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 271, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [214.6686553955078, 400.6337890625], "pos": [370, 710.6900024414062], "id": 125, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SamplerCustomAdvanced"}, "order": 39}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [278], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MA